# Code ownership for review routing.
# Replace the placeholder owners below with real GitHub teams/users before
# enabling "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection.
#
# Syntax: <path pattern>  <@owner> [<@owner> ...]
# Later matches take precedence over earlier ones.

# Default owner for everything.
*                       @your-org/frontend-platform

# Architecture, conventions, and agent instructions: require platform review.
/docs/                  @your-org/frontend-platform
/AGENTS.md              @your-org/frontend-platform
/src/**/AGENTS.md       @your-org/frontend-platform
/.cursor/               @your-org/frontend-platform

# Tooling, CI, and security posture.
/.github/               @your-org/frontend-platform
/biome.json             @your-org/frontend-platform
/tsconfig*.json         @your-org/frontend-platform
/vite.config.ts         @your-org/frontend-platform
